(7053468, 1072738, 24073, '<td valign="top">My gosh this is fantastic, I would love to put this on any wall in my house.  What a terrific job, but unfortunately I just don''t see a real connection to the challenge, I hate to take away from all the others who really made "seven" stand out.  I do get the title, just not "seven" to me.  There is noway to tell you how gorgeous i think this is otherwise.  Beautiful, great job.</td>', 'My gosh this is fantastic, I would love to put this on any wall in my house.  What a terrific job, but unfortunately I just don''t see a real connection to the challenge, I hate to take away from all the others who really made "seven" stand out.  I do get the title, just not "seven" to me.  There is noway to tell you how gorgeous i think this is otherwise.  Beautiful, great job.', '2013-06-19 19:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7053470, 1072351, 24073, '<td valign="top">Gonna be a battle to first with this one, but I think it should win.  The birds actually in flight hit the spot.  Amazing that you was able to maintain balance, and have your "seven" in there.  Great job, outstanding work.</td>', 'Gonna be a battle to first with this one, but I think it should win.  The birds actually in flight hit the spot.  Amazing that you was able to maintain balance, and have your "seven" in there.  Great job, outstanding work.', '2013-06-19 19:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7053473, 1072675, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is just a fantastic, technically sound, challenge met, great job.  Shows great skill, I''m going to go out on a limb, and say once this challenge is done, your one of the more skilled photographers, not just a luck shot, and it shows.</td>', 'This is just a fantastic, technically sound, challenge met, great job.  Shows great skill, I''m going to go out on a limb, and say once this challenge is done, your one of the more skilled photographers, not just a luck shot, and it shows.', '2013-06-19 19:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
