(7057553, 1072723, 92512, '<td valign="top">Critique club comment:<br/> <br/>I like the way this is composed. The black and white sets a mood that is also appealing to the viewer. It meets the contest requirements yet can still can fit in other categories as well. In other words this photo in itself in a great image beyond the limited guidelines of seven objects. It is also true to your style of photography. IMHO very well done. Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'Critique club comment: I like the way this is composed. The black and white sets a mood that is also appealing to the viewer. It meets the contest requirements yet can still can fit in other categories as well. In other words this photo in itself in a great image beyond the limited guidelines of seven objects. It is also true to your style of photography. IMHO very well done. Thank you for sharing.', '2013-06-29 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7057561, 1072616, 92512, '<td valign="top">Critique club comment;<br/>Very creative and well executed. I may have not cropped as tightly as to get the edges of the mirror in the photo but that may have taken away for the wine glasses. "Just a thought". The use of the negative space complements the photo as well. All in all it is a great photo.</td>', 'Critique club comment;Very creative and well executed. I may have not cropped as tightly as to get the edges of the mirror in the photo but that may have taken away for the wine glasses. "Just a thought". The use of the negative space complements the photo as well. All in all it is a great photo.', '2013-06-29 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 0),
